sequenceDiagram
    participant Authority as Authority User
    participant GateEE as eFTI Gate (eu-ee31)
    participant GateFI as Remote Gate (eu-fi01)
    participant Platform as Platform (plt-fi-001)

    Authority->>+GateEE: GET /v1/dataset/eu-fi01/plt-fi-001/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890?subsetId=full
    Note over Authority,GateEE: Authorization: Bearer aut-demo-key<br/>X-Request-ID: req-e5f6a7b8

    GateEE->>GateEE: Authenticate & authorize (role=AUTHORITY)
    GateEE->>GateEE: Forward to remote gate eu-fi01

    GateEE->>+GateFI: eDelivery AS4: UILQueryRequest<br/>(subsetId=full, requestId=req-e5f6a7b8)

    GateFI->>+Platform: GET /v1/datasets/a1b2c3d4-...?subsetId=full

    alt Platform denies access (403)
        Platform-->>GateFI: 403 Forbidden\n{"error": "Access denied: authority not authorized for full subset"}
        GateFI-->>GateEE: UILQueryResponse{status=403, body=&lt;description&gt;Access denied...&lt;/description&gt;}
        GateEE-->>Authority: 403 Forbidden (application/xml)\n&lt;description&gt;Access denied: authority not authorized for full subset&lt;/description&gt;

    else Platform dataset not found (404)
        Platform-->>GateFI: 404 Not Found\n{"error": "Dataset not found or expired"}
        GateFI-->>GateEE: UILQueryResponse{status=404, body=&lt;description&gt;Dataset not found...&lt;/description&gt;}
        GateEE-->>Authority: 404 Not Found (application/xml)\n&lt;description&gt;Dataset not found or expired&lt;/description&gt;

    else Platform unreachable (502)
        Platform-->>-GateFI: Connection timeout / 5xx
        GateFI-->>-GateEE: UILQueryResponse{status=500, body=&lt;description&gt;Platform error&lt;/description&gt;}
        GateEE-->>Authority: 502 Bad Gateway (application/xml)\n&lt;description&gt;Platform error&lt;/description&gt;
    end

    GateEE-->>-Authority: Error response
    Note over Authority: Dataset access denied or unavailable.<br/>Authority may send follow-up (seq-10).
